From: Gabriel Fernandez <gabriel.fernandez@foss.st.com>
Date: Mon, 11 Mar 2024 10:20:57 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 0704/1695] drivers: clk: fix coding style issues in stm32mp25
 clock driver

Update stm32mp25 drivers to meet OP-TEE OS coding style standard.

Most #ifdef pre-compiler directives are remove to better leverage
compiler coding analysis even when the related configuration switches
are disabled.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git ff842eebcc7d06102eb639675927906176f9de04 drivers: clk: fix coding style issues in stm32mp25 clock driver]
